# 11. Roboflow Model Recommendations

Use these datasets/models (or similar) from Roboflow as baseline:

### Player Detection

* football-players-detection (high quality, widely used)
* soccer-players-5 (good for small-sided games like football 7)

### Ball Detection

* football-ball-detection (optimized for motion blur)
* soccer-ball-zoom (better for broadcast footage)

### Field Detection

* football-field-detection (keypoints + lines)
* soccer-pitch-lines (useful for calibration)

### Segmentation

* football-pitch-segmentation (clean masks for filtering)

### Pose

* soccer-players-pose (if available, otherwise fine-tune YOLO pose)

